From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 21:21:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add ui_line_height setting for UI panels

Port of zed-industries/zed#51271. Adds a configurable ui_line_height
setting (comfortable/standard/custom) that controls item heights in the
file tree, git panel, and outline panel. Parallels buffer_line_height.

Skips collab_panel.rs changes since collab_ui is stripped in Zedium.
Adds theme_settings::UiLineHeight to public exports.
